  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Provide Clean Water for Rural Villages in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will drill boreholes for rural communities in Anambra State, in order to provide them with clean water and protect the lives of the children therein. Clean water is important for public health, whether it&apos;s for drinking or domestic use. Many residents in Anambra treks to hilly streams to fetch water. Over 60 million people in Nigeria still lack access to clean water, leading to transmission of waterborne diseases like diarrhea, killing over 700,000 children under 5 years annually.</narrative>
  </description>
